caption: Drive Mark
rule: drive-mark

A record that a character fulfilled one Drive during a session. A character can earn no more than one Drive Mark from the same Drive in the same session. Other GATES subsystems may use the word Mark for physical or metaphysical signs; those are not Drive Marks unless explicitly stated.
